      ],
      "text": "Social/Emotional:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " copies other children while playing; shows you an object she likes; claps when excited; hugs a stuffed doll/toy; shows you affection (hugs, cuddles, kisses). "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Language/Communication:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " tries to say one or two words besides \"mama\"/\"dada\" (ex, \"ba\" for ball); looks @ a familiar object when you name it; follows directions given w both a gesture and words; points to ask for something or to get help. "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Cog:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " tries to use things the Rt way (phone, cup, book); stacks at least two sm objects (blocks). "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "mvt/Physical:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " takes a few steps on his own; uses fingers to feed herself some food. [S3]"
